  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_033) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.713). However, the role of image encoder choice (resnet50 vs. imagenet_vit_l) remains uncertain. This experiment tests the same multimodal setup but with imagenet_vit_l, isolating the impact of the image encoder. It directly addresses a key design choice (image encoder) while building on the promising multimodal framework established by config_033, balancing exploitation of high-performing configurations with exploration of critical uncertainties."
